  "lines": {
    "1": "「It has gotten terribly late.」",
    "2": "「Nighttime's depressing when I can't see a thing. Inori, if you're done working, let's hurry home.」",
    "3": "「He... lp... me...」",
    "4": "「Did you hear something?」",
    "5": "「Maybe it's a ghost.」",
    "6": "「My, a ghost.」",
    "7": "「I have always wanted to meet one. How fortunate.」",
    "8": "「We could put it on display and make a fortune.」",
    "9": "「You're scarier than any ghost.」",
    "10": "「The voice came from over here.」",
    "11": "「Heeelp meee...」",
    "12": "「My, my. This locker is talking.」",
    "13": "「Just help me already!」",
    "14": "「Move that thing bracing the door.」",
    "15": "Clunk.",
    "16": "「Hah... Hah... Hah... Finally, I'm out.」",
    "17": "「...」",
    "18": "「There is no bullying here.」",
    "19": "「Where are you even looking when you say that? There's nobody here!」",
    "20": "............."
  }
